73
00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.593
All right.
so six cameras. right?

74
00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.240
One. two. three.

75
00:06:57.320 --> 00:07:00.153
four. five. six.

76
00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:02.231
What. is that too much?
Yeah. maybe.

77
00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:04.550
Yeah. it's too much.
I thought that.

78
00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:06.153
They're baby gifts
