79
00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:08.949
I'll take them down.

80
00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:12.919
All we need
is one baby monitor.

81
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.195
One baby monitor.
right. okay.

82
00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:19.196
And a Kevlar mattress.

83
00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:22.589
Come here.

84
