Unhand me.
Never.

85
00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.554
And guess who just got
the next week off?

86
00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:33.320
Oh. don't toy with me. young man.
'cause there will be consequences.

87
00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:35.316
No. no. we're finishing
this nursery.

88
00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:37.550
I can't believe it's
taken me this long.

89
00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:41.076
Paint samples.
What?

90
00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:45.517
Yeah. Oh. I gotta show you these
amazing new paint samples.

91
00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:46.635
Can I get
a shower first?

92
00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:47.720
God. yes!

93
00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.235
Sir. Speaker of the House
is waiting.

94
00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:50.232
