01:31:10.040 --> 01:31:13.316
<i>if we would just
mind our own business.</i>

1025
01:31:13.440 --> 01:31:16.034
<i>Nothing could be
farther from the truth.</i>

1026
01:31:16.240 --> 01:31:20.472
<i>Frankly. we live in a dangerous
world and we have few good options.</i>

1027
01:31:20.600 --> 01:31:24.639
<i>But the worst option
is to do nothing.</i>

1028
01:31:24.720 --> 01:31:26.312
<i>And finally.</i>

1029
01:31:26.560 --> 01:31:29.518
<i>we owe it to our children
and to their children</i>

1030
01:31:29.600 --> 01:31:31.591
<i>to engage in the world.</i>

1031
01:31:32.960 --> 01:31:34.552
<i>God bless you all</i>

1032
01:31:35.400 --> 01:31:38.915
<i>and God bless
the United States of America.</i>

1033
01:31:39.000 --> 01:31:41.958
<i>That was Vice President Trumbull
live from the White House.</i>

1033
